        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "722430101": {
            "id": "722430101",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Marjorie",
            "text": "Welcome, Traveler. Do you need something?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722430102"
            ]
          },
          "722430102": {
            "id": "722430102",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I've got some treasure I want to sell.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722430103"
            ]
          },
          "722430103": {
            "id": "722430103",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Marjorie",
            "text": "You want to sell treasure? That's quite a surprise.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722430104"
            ]
          },
          "722430104": {
            "id": "722430104",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Marjorie",
            "text": "I imagine that an adventurer as skilled as you must have some truly rare goods to sell.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722430105"
            ]
          },
          "722430105": {
            "id": "722430105",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Marjorie",
            "text": "Let me have a look.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722430106"
            ]
          },
          "722430106": {
            "id": "722430106",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "You tell Marjorie about the Dragonbone Orb.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722430107"
            ]
          },
          "722430107": {
            "id": "722430107",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Marjorie",
            "text": "Huh, isn't this what the bards called the \"Fretnaught Fruit\"?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722430108"
            ]
          },
          "722430108": {
            "id": "722430108",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Marjorie",
            "text": "To think that it really exists... So its real name is the Dragonbone Orb.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722430109"
            ]
          },
          "722430109": {
            "id": "722430109",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Marjorie",
            "text": "If its effects are as you say, I'd be willing to pay 80,000 Mora and some specialty dishes for it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722430110"
            ]
          },
          "722430110": {
            "id": "722430110",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Marjorie",
            "text": "Hmm... How does 80,000 Mora and 5 Moon Pies sound to you?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722430112",
              "722430115",
              "722430121"
            ]
          },
          "722430112": {
            "id": "722430112",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Marjorie",
            "text": "Hehe. I mean, it's such a unique treasure.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722430113"
            ]
          },
          "722430113": {
            "id": "722430113",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Marjorie",
            "text": "Why, it has abilities straight out of a fairy tale! I doubt those alchemists would be loath to part with their Mora."
          },
          "722430115": {
            "id": "722430115",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Marjorie",
            "text": "I'll take this, then. Thanks for your patronage!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722430116"
            ]
          },
          "722430116": {
            "id": "722430116",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Marjorie",
            "text": "Ah yes. Such beads formed from condensation tend to evaporate slowly in the wind.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722430117"
            ]
          },
          "722430117": {
            "id": "722430117",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Marjorie",
            "text": "As such, it might be best to cover it with a diaphragm or place it within a sealed container to ensure its quality.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722430118"
            ]
          },
          "722430118": {
            "id": "722430118",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Marjorie",
            "text": "I'll give you this tip free of charge. Hopefully, it'll be of some use to you in your adventures.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722430119"
            ]
          },
          "722430119": {
            "id": "722430119",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Marjorie",
            "text": "If you encounter such treasures in the future, always remember that you'll have a loyal buyer in me!"
          },
          "722430121": {
            "id": "722430121",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Marjorie",
            "text": "Sure, no problem. Nonetheless, I have confidence in my estimation of this item's value.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722430122"
            ]
          },
          "722430122": {
            "id": "722430122",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Marjorie",
            "text": "You can come to me again once you've mulled the matter over."
          }
        }
      }
    },
